  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The angle θ between a ramp and a horizontal surface slowly increases from zero. An object on the ramp does not slide as θ increases.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The frictional force on the object is</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">constant.</li><li data-label=\"B\">negligible.</li><li data-label=\"C\">proportional to cos θ.</li><li data-label=\"D\">proportional to sin θ.</li></ol>"
